{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "因入內殿頭俞源清奉宣到院修法華三昧三晝夜欲知懺法\n旨趣故述此以示之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五果者壽色力辨安"}
