{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "竟"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "巨至切及也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "他各切斥開也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "憒胡對切心亂也閙女教切不\n靜也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "古杏切與哽同哽咽悲塞也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "且緣切量也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "𢟋音堆惕\n他的切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "丘媿切歎息聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "郭禮切股也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "筌且緣切魚笱也窮\n杜𠔃切兔𥥖也"}
{"id": null, "n": "0842b0501", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0842b0501", "type": "add", "text": "CBETA 按：原書科判「一用心無久近」，今根據前後文意修訂為「二用心無久近」。"}
